Description: Boot firmware for the M5Stack CoreMP135 (TF-A, OP-TEE, U-Boot)
 Installs the TF-A BL2 image and the FIP (OP-TEE + U-Boot) built from
 upstream sources to /usr/lib/coremp135/firmware. Nothing is written to
 the SD card automatically: run `coremp135-flash-bootloader` to update the
 boot partitions.
